{"id":"96aa7c2f3c33ea30","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-godel-rosser.md","title":"Gödel–Rosser 不完全性","display":"thm-godel-rosser — Gödel–Rosser 不完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-godel-rosser","aliases":["20-thm-godel-rosser"],"display":"thm-godel-rosser — Gödel–Rosser 不完全性","chapter":"10","section":"10.1","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"source-verified","source_reference":"Theorem 10.1.2","source_pdf_pages":[215],"source_printed_pages":[183],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pa]]","[[20-df-completion]]","[[20-df-provable]]","[[20-df-re]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-godel-rosser"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-godel-rosser</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-godel-rosser — Gödel–Rosser 不完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-verified"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.1.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>215</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>183</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是一致、可计算枚举公理化的一阶理论，包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{PA}\\)</span>；P 为固定经典逻辑证明系统。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e01ee20e163d443\" href=\"?note=4e01ee20e163d443\" title=\"20-df-pa\">20-df-pa</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea674d0eb2839a85\" href=\"?note=ea674d0eb2839a85\" title=\"20-df-provable\">20-df-provable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}rosser}\\vdash\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\not\\vdash_P\\theta\\land T\\not\\vdash_P\\neg\\theta].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}godel\\text{-}rosser}\\vdash\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\operatorname{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{PA})\\\n[T\\not\\vdash_P\\theta\\land T\\not\\vdash_P\\neg\\theta].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Rosser 的证明谓词比较两种互补证明的最小编码，用语法自指构造独立句；一致性即可，不额外假定 omega 一致性。完整形式化证明不在本目录重建，陈述与原书核实。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.1.2；印刷页 183；PDF 第 215 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pa","status":"resolved","id":"4e01ee20e163d443","anchor":"ref-1",